WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.200
-Donald Trump took the next step

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.934
in his slow-moving coup
over the weekend

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:06.400
when he went to Michigan
for a rally,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.901
in part, to support fringe
state-level candidates

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:11.834
who support the big lie that
the 2020 election was stolen

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.968
and would wield power over
future elections in the state.

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.434
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.367
The quasi-religious mythology

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:25.167
Trump's followers
have built around him

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:27.667
have now gotten
so detached from reality,

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.734
they're erasing
the things he has done

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.968
while giving him credit
for things he hasn't done.

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:34.100
For example, former
Vice President Mike Pence --

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.133
you know, the guy Trump
supporters threatened to hang

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.601
while Trump stood by silently --

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.467
said this over the weekend
on Fox News.

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:42.767
-President Biden has done
more damage to America

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:46.133
than any president
in modern history.

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.634
-Wow. How strict is your
definition of "modern history"?

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:53.100
[ As Pence ] Modern history
is everything since the slap.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:00.701
Then from 900 A.D. to the slap,
that's the Middle Ages.

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:01.968
[ Normal voice ] But seriously,
man, what's your deal?

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:04.033
You're still trying
to win over Trump voters?

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:07.667
They stormed the Capitol and
they chanted, "Hang Mike Pence."

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.734
That's you.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.934
You're like a guy
who gets a fake number

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.033
from a woman at a bar
and keeps calling it,

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.300
hoping to get a date.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.300
"Hello. Is Alice there?

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.467
Well, this is the number
she wrote on the bar napkin."

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:23.334
"Well, you don't
have to be rude.

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:24.934
And can I just add,
I don't think kids

00:01:24.934 --> 00:01:28.701
are old enough
to have their own cars."

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:31.834
Or maybe Pence thinks Biden
is worse than Trump

00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:33.334
because he was asleep
during the entirety

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:34.901
of the Trump presidency,
which is possible,

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:37.100
given that in every meeting
he had his eyes closed

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.601
like he was desperately hoping
no one would notice him.

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:42.100
He's got his eyes closed like
he's trying not to throw up

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.501
on a state fair Tilt-A-Whirl.

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:48.133
These Trump toadies are all
such obsequious little worms,

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:51.000
but Pence's faux gravitas makes
him that much more insufferable,

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.200
the head shaking,
the solemn tone,

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.501
the put-on folksy demeanor.

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:57.000
He looks and moves
like a Chuck E. Cheese robot

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.934
who tells the band
to keep it down.

00:01:58.934 --> 00:02:00.734
[ As Pence ] Fellas,
it's loud enough in here

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.901
with all the dang kids
screaming.

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:04.200
[ Normal voice ]
But Trump sycophants

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.000
aren't just trying to erase
his many failures,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.501
they're also trying
to give him credit

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:08.901
for things
he had nothing to do with.

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:10.267
For example, on Saturday,

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:13.300
sitting member of Congress
Representative Lisa McClain

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.934
said at a Trump rally
in Michigan

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.634
that it was Trump
who had found Osama bin Laden.

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:21.300
-While President Trump
was in office,

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.868
we didn't have a war,

00:02:22.868 --> 00:02:26.868
and I think he made
three peace treaties,

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:34.400
caught Osama bin Laden
and Soleimani, al-Baghdadi.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.000
And this president is weak.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.701
And I'll tell you,
weakness breeds aggression.

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:42.467
We need strength.

00:02:42.467 --> 00:02:44.567
-Yeah, we need strength --
the kind of strength it takes

00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:46.267
to find and kill
an elusive terrorist

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:48.100
while simultaneously
hosting a game show

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.467
with your wet,
asymmetrical sons.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.534
Was finding bin Laden one of
the tasks on "The Apprentice"?

00:02:54.534 --> 00:02:56.334
[ As Trump ] Jose Canseco,
you need to create

00:02:56.334 --> 00:02:58.968
a 60-second commercial
for the new OnStar mirror.

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:02.100
And, Lisa Rinna, you're off
to Abbottabad, Pakistan...

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:06.334
...to look for clues.
You can do it, Lisa.

00:03:06.334 --> 00:03:08.267
[ Normal voice ] Seriously,
these people should have to take

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:10.000
the same kind of tests
to stay in Congress

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.501
that you give a boxer to make
sure they can stay in the fight.

00:03:12.501 --> 00:03:14.501
"How many fingers
am I holding up?" "16."

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:16.467
"What year is it?"
"3069."

00:03:16.467 --> 00:03:18.167
"Who killed Osama bin Laden?"
"Donald Trump."

00:03:18.167 --> 00:03:20.701
"Okay, we're calling it."

00:03:20.701 --> 00:03:22.133
Would you seriously not remember

00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:23.868
that famous photo
where Barack Obama,

00:03:23.868 --> 00:03:25.767
Hillary Clinton, and Joe Biden
were in the situation room

00:03:25.767 --> 00:03:26.901
watching the raid
as it happened?

00:03:26.901 --> 00:03:28.567
Is there some Photoshop version

00:03:28.567 --> 00:03:30.634
floating around
on the QAnon forums

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:32.200
where Trump is sitting
in the middle of the picture

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:35.367
in that stance he always has,
like he's trying to crowd out

00:03:35.367 --> 00:03:36.934
the people next to him
on the subway?

00:03:36.934 --> 00:03:38.534
"Excuse me.
Can you move?

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:40.400
I need at least
an entire row to myself.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.567
I can't close my legs.

00:03:41.567 --> 00:03:44.133
I have to have my back-back
on the ground.

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:46.300
It's also especially
galling to give Trump credit

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.534
for catching bin Laden,
given that Trump himself

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:50.400
dismissed it
as a non-accomplishment

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:53.300
when the admiral in charge
of the raid, William McRaven,

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.767
publicly criticized Trump
during his presidency.

00:03:55.767 --> 00:04:00.133
-Bill McRaven, retired admiral,
Navy SEAL, 37 years,

00:04:00.133 --> 00:04:01.634
former head
of U.S. Special Operations...

00:04:01.634 --> 00:04:03.033
-Hillary Clinton fan.

00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:04.334
-...Special Operations...
-Excuse me.

00:04:04.334 --> 00:04:05.834
Hillary Clinton fan.

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:09.000
-...who led the operations,
commanded the operations

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.267
that took down Saddam Hussein
and that killed Osama bin Laden,

00:04:12.267 --> 00:04:15.501
says that your sentiment is
the greatest threat to democracy

00:04:15.501 --> 00:04:16.801
in his lifetime.
-Okay.

00:04:16.801 --> 00:04:21.701
He's a Hillary Clinton backer
and an Obama backer,

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:24.000
and, frankly...
-He was a Navy SEAL.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.300
-...wouldn't it have been nice
if we got Osama bin Laden

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.767
a lot sooner than that?

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:29.133
Wouldn't it have been nice?
You know, living --

00:04:29.133 --> 00:04:31.434
Think of this --
living in Pakistan,

00:04:31.434 --> 00:04:32.701
beautifully in Pakistan

00:04:32.701 --> 00:04:34.901
in what I guess
they considered a nice mansion.

00:04:34.901 --> 00:04:36.567
I don't know.
I've seen nicer.

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:38.200
-Alright, couple of things.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.267
First of all, stop shouting
"Hillary Clinton fan"

00:04:40.267 --> 00:04:43.033
like a guy on "Wheel of Fortune"
who insists his answer is right.

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.000
[ As Trump ] Pat, I'd like
to solve the puzzle.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.367
Hillary Clinton fan.

00:04:46.367 --> 00:04:47.467
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:47.467 --> 00:04:49.968
Hillary Clinton fan.
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:49.968 --> 00:04:52.801
[ Normal voice ] Okay,
let's turn around the letters,

00:04:52.801 --> 00:04:55.501
and we see that the answer is...

00:04:55.501 --> 00:05:00.067
[ As Trump ] Uhhhh...

00:05:00.067 --> 00:05:01.901
Hillary Clinton fan.

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:03.968
[ Buzzer ]

00:05:03.968 --> 00:05:06.167
[ Normal voice ] Also, let's
go back to this for a second,

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:09.133
because this is
a perfect Trump sentence.

00:05:09.133 --> 00:05:11.534
-Living in Pakistan,
beautifully in Pakistan

00:05:11.534 --> 00:05:13.734
in what I guess
they considered a nice mansion.

00:05:13.734 --> 00:05:15.200
I don't know.
I've seen nicer.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.467
-He wants to shame McRaven for
not catching bin Laden sooner

00:05:18.467 --> 00:05:20.267
by saying he was living
in a beautiful mansion.

00:05:20.267 --> 00:05:23.367
But he also can't stop himself
from [bleep] on the mansion.

00:05:23.367 --> 00:05:25.067
And look, like everyone,
I was upset

00:05:25.067 --> 00:05:26.934
when I heard bin Laden
was living in a mansion,

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:28.801
and then I saw it and thought,
"Okay.

00:05:28.801 --> 00:05:30.701
That makes me feel
a little bit better."

00:05:30.701 --> 00:05:32.534
On a smaller scale,
it's how I feel

00:05:32.534 --> 00:05:33.934
when I see a picture of Trump

00:05:33.934 --> 00:05:36.300
at the omelet bar
at his golf club.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.634
Sure, he's a free man, but those
look like [bleep] eggs,

00:05:38.634 --> 00:05:41.100
and that makes me smile
a little bit.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:43.534
Also, it's pretty rich for Trump
to insinuate the admiral

00:05:43.534 --> 00:05:45.167
who caught the world's
most wanted terrorist

00:05:45.167 --> 00:05:46.968
should have done it sooner,
considering we're still waiting

00:05:46.968 --> 00:05:50.400
on the tax returns
Trump promised us in 2016.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.334
Maybe Obama had to wait for
the raid for the same reason

00:05:53.334 --> 00:05:54.501
we're still waiting for that.

00:05:54.501 --> 00:05:55.868
"We know where he is,
Mr. President,

00:05:55.868 --> 00:05:58.234
but our intel tells us
he's being audited by the IRS."

00:05:58.234 --> 00:06:00.734
[ As Obama ] Well, then
we, uh...have to wait.

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:01.901
[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.901 --> 00:06:03.400
[ Normal voice ] Anyway,
McClain made that comment

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.100
in Michigan over the weekend

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.334
at yet another one of Trump's
unhinged rallies.

00:06:07.334 --> 00:06:10.834
And at first, it may have seemed
like a typical Trump rally,

00:06:10.834 --> 00:06:12.567
not worth paying
much attention to,

00:06:12.567 --> 00:06:14.634
given that most of it
was his usual shtick.

00:06:14.634 --> 00:06:17.033
For example, Trump did
that thing he always does

00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:19.400
where he says something,
then predicts that the media

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.968
will criticize him
for saying it.

00:06:20.968 --> 00:06:22.300
-I knew Putin very well.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.267
You know, they say,
"Oh, he knows Putin.

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:25.801
He knows Putin. Oh."

00:06:25.801 --> 00:06:27.567
That's a good thing,
not a bad thing.

00:06:27.567 --> 00:06:30.801
I know Kim Jong-un.
I know President Xi of China.

00:06:30.801 --> 00:06:34.467
-Why are you just listing
off people, you know?

00:06:34.467 --> 00:06:36.501
You sound like a 5-year-old
rattling off

00:06:36.501 --> 00:06:38.300
which dinosaur stickers he has.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.367
"I got triceratops.
I got brontosaurus.

00:06:41.367 --> 00:06:44.934
I got doubles of pterodactyl."

00:06:44.934 --> 00:06:48.067
Also, no one is mad
that you know dictators.

00:06:48.067 --> 00:06:51.501
They're mad because you admire
and seek to emulate them.

00:06:51.501 --> 00:06:53.667
You've constantly lavished
praise on Vladimir Putin

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:56.133
as he criminally interfered
in American democracy

00:06:56.133 --> 00:06:58.667
and waged a brutal war on
an innocent neighboring country.

00:06:58.667 --> 00:07:01.801
And in general, you're clearly
desperate to mimic autocrats,

00:07:01.801 --> 00:07:03.067
like during a previous rally

00:07:03.067 --> 00:07:05.834
when Trump said
President Xi of China was smart

00:07:05.834 --> 00:07:08.501
because he rules his country
like a ruthless tyrant.

00:07:08.501 --> 00:07:10.767
-You know, every time I say
somebody's smart,

00:07:10.767 --> 00:07:13.400
they always go, "Oh, Trump said

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:17.901
that President Xi of China
is smart."

00:07:17.901 --> 00:07:21.968
Well, you know,
he runs 1.5 billion people

00:07:21.968 --> 00:07:24.133
with an iron fist.

00:07:24.133 --> 00:07:27.634
Yeah, I think he's pretty smart.

00:07:27.634 --> 00:07:28.968
And they have a chain
over there.

00:07:28.968 --> 00:07:30.868
You know, if you're a dummy,
you get left here.

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:33.467
It's like this.
It's like a pyramid.

00:07:33.467 --> 00:07:35.634
The smartest one
gets to the top.

00:07:35.634 --> 00:07:37.334
-I think you're confusing
a dictatorship

00:07:37.334 --> 00:07:40.300
with a cheerleading squad.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.300
[ As Trump ] They put the
smartest cheerleader at the top

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.334
because then
if the pyramid collapses,

00:07:44.334 --> 00:07:46.100
maybe you lose a few idiots.

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.968
But Becky still
goes to Princeton.

00:07:47.968 --> 00:07:49.734
[ Laughter ]

00:07:49.734 --> 00:07:51.367
[ Normal voice ]
Although I'm guessing
there are some similarities.

00:07:51.367 --> 00:07:53.067
"Janice, if you don't get
your [bleep] together

00:07:53.067 --> 00:07:56.734
and nail this basket toss,
we are not going to make state."

00:07:56.734 --> 00:07:58.868
By the way, you might think
because I'm a 48-year-old man

00:07:58.868 --> 00:08:01.367
and a father of three, I haven't
seen the movie "Bring It On."

00:08:01.367 --> 00:08:02.801
But guess what.
You're wrong.

00:08:02.801 --> 00:08:04.734
Because it came out
22 years ago,

00:08:04.734 --> 00:08:06.267
when I was childless and happy.

00:08:06.267 --> 00:08:09.367
In fact, I would even --
Look, I love my kids.

00:08:09.367 --> 00:08:11.334
I just haven't seen that movie
in like a month.

00:08:11.334 --> 00:08:15.834
In fact, I would even
go so far to say

00:08:15.834 --> 00:08:20.868
that Trump wants to turn our
democracy into a cheerocracy.

00:08:20.868 --> 00:08:24.501
And that's today's unnecessary
"Bring It On" reference.

00:08:24.501 --> 00:08:27.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:29.267 --> 00:08:32.901
Also, I love Trump's theory
that the dummies

00:08:32.901 --> 00:08:35.234
get left at the bottom
in a dictatorship.

00:08:35.234 --> 00:08:38.133
Let's hope Rudy Giuliani never
has to find his way to the top

00:08:38.133 --> 00:08:39.834
in a Trump dictatorship.

00:08:39.834 --> 00:08:44.234
-From the top to the bottom,
from the middle to the side.

00:08:44.234 --> 00:08:46.067
[ As Giuliani ] Good news --
They told me I'm going to be

00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:48.767
all the way up here at the top
because I'm smart.

00:08:48.767 --> 00:08:51.234
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.234 --> 00:08:53.601
[ Normal voice ]
That's such a revealing window
into Trump's worldview.

00:08:53.601 --> 00:08:55.801
If you're a tyrant who rules
with an iron fist,

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:57.901
that makes you smart,
well, democracy is for suckers.

00:08:57.901 --> 00:08:59.267
In fact, at his Michigan rally,

00:08:59.267 --> 00:09:01.567
Trump even joked about
what it would have sounded like

00:09:01.567 --> 00:09:02.834
if he'd conceded,

00:09:02.834 --> 00:09:05.000
mocking it like
it was some dumb idea.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.501
-Be a lot easier
for me to say, "Oh."

00:09:07.501 --> 00:09:10.667
Be a lot easier for me to do
like many people have done,

00:09:10.667 --> 00:09:14.067
get up and just say
congratulations,

00:09:14.067 --> 00:09:15.701
whoever it is
I'm running against.

00:09:15.701 --> 00:09:19.734
I mean, if you're running,
I'd say, "Congratulations, Joe."

00:09:19.734 --> 00:09:22.801
-Why is his Trump impression
so bad?

00:09:22.801 --> 00:09:24.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:26.834
So every everyone
has a Donald Trump

00:09:26.834 --> 00:09:29.467
except Donald Trump?

00:09:29.467 --> 00:09:32.801
He sounds like Vincent D'Onofrio
from "Men in Black."

00:09:32.801 --> 00:09:34.767
[ Muttering indistinctly ]

00:09:34.767 --> 00:09:36.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:41.901 --> 00:09:43.934
[ As Trump ] I think my Trump's
getting pretty good.

00:09:43.934 --> 00:09:45.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.300
[ Normal voice ] Like that,
what you're doing right now.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:48.467
[ As Trump ] What,
like I'm doing right now.

00:09:48.467 --> 00:09:51.033
No, this isn't.
[ Mutters indistinctly ]

00:09:51.033 --> 00:09:52.167
That's how I sound.

00:09:52.167 --> 00:09:53.934
[ Mutters indistinctly ]

00:09:53.934 --> 00:09:57.400
[ Normal voice ] To Trump, the
idea of conceding when you lose

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.501
is laughable.

00:09:58.501 --> 00:10:00.501
It's a joke,
only something suckers do.

00:10:00.501 --> 00:10:02.200
And that's why he was
really there --

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.334
for his ongoing attempt
to end American democracy

00:10:04.334 --> 00:10:07.634
and install himself or whoever
the next Republican nominee is

00:10:07.634 --> 00:10:09.100
as an unelected autocrat.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.534
Because by his own admission,
Trump was there in part

00:10:11.534 --> 00:10:13.901
to campaign for state-level
GOP candidates

00:10:13.901 --> 00:10:15.501
who have embraced the big lie

00:10:15.501 --> 00:10:17.601
and would wield power
over Michigan's elections

00:10:17.601 --> 00:10:18.868
in 2024 if they win.

00:10:18.868 --> 00:10:21.267
